        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Working a non-Company job inconsistent with the restrictions provided by your health care provider while on Family and Medical Leave or any other authorized leave of absence is considered a voluntary resignation. Unless on intermittent leave, you may not perform any work for the Company during the time period your health care provider certifies you are disabled from work.",
